    <x:String x:Key="Diag_ResolveIdeviceWin">将 idevice_id.exe 放入“idevice-tools”目录，或为 Windows 安装 libimobiledevice。</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Diag_ResolveIdeviceMac">在终端中运行：'brew install libimobiledevice'。</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Diag_ResolveIdeviceLinux">在终端中运行：'sudo apt-get install libimobiledevice-utils'。</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Diag_ResolveIdeviceinfo">请确认已安装完整的 libimobiledevice 组件。</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Diag_ResolveAdbWin">安装 Android SDK Platform-Tools，或将 adb.exe 复制到 idevice-tools 目录。</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Diag_ResolveAdbMac">在终端中运行：'brew install android-platform-tools'。</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Diag_ResolveAdbLinux">在终端中运行：'sudo apt-get install adb'。</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Diag_ResolveTunnel">安装通道连接器，或将 cloudflared 放入“idevice-tools”目录。</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Diag_ResolveUsbmuxdPortable">启动便携版 usbmuxd 后台守护进程。</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Diag_ResolveAppleService">下载并安装轻量版 Apple 驱动和 usbmuxd 守护进程。</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Diag_ResolveUsbmuxdMac">请确认 usbmuxd 正在运行，或重启电脑。</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Diag_ResolveUsbmuxdLinux">运行：'sudo systemctl start usbmuxd' 或 'sudo usbmuxd -f -v'。</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Diag_ResolveUsbCable">检查 USB 线缆，尝试直接插在电脑上的另一个 USB 接口（不要用集线器），并解锁手机，如出现提示请点按“信任”。</x:String>

    <!-- Colour names. The device data holds the key, and each of these is one
         key in one language. The Dutch values are the ones the app shipped
         with, moved here so nothing on screen or on paper has to be Dutch by
         accident. -->
